From b13f524006421b1fbc333183669838f2e59f7917 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Manoj Kumar Prabakaran <manojkumar.prabakaran@arm.com>
Date: Fri, 7 Aug 2026 18:33:11 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] dsp: platform: Add tagged numeric sensor decode API

Introduce decode_numeric_sensor_data_to_value() for numeric sensor
event data. The new API returns the sensor data size together
with the decoded reading, allowing callers to handle 64-bit sensor
values without changing the stable decode_numeric_sensor_data() ABI.

Upstream-Status: Submitted [https://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/libpldm/+/93303]

Change-Id: I4b211ce70f8d5add0d7e717b3244b6d2e3e20d73
Signed-off-by: Vignesh Natarajan <Vignesh.Natarajan@arm.com>
Signed-off-by: Manoj Kumar Prabakaran <manojkumar.prabakaran@arm.com>
---
